  "details": "Hi VRChat Team,\n\nI wanted to bring to your attention a recurring issue several users have come to me about: duplicated entries of people appearing in their friends list. This glitch is happening across both the app and the website on many platforms.\n\nSo far, five users have reached out directly, and one has shared a screenshot as visual confirmation. While it may already be on your radar, I figured it was worth flagging just in case.\n\nThanks as always for your continued work and dedication. I'm backing you all the way.\n\nBest,\n\nNuvoria",
